# Azshara (Horde) - Recipes companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes, patterns, formulas, plans and schematics whose SOURCE is
# physically in Azshara for a Horde buyer, verified against the local
# Forever game data (questie-forever item vendor and drop tables). Four
# are vendor-sold by the two neutral auction-house goblins (Jubie and Blimo
# Gadgetspring — every buy carries an npc pin to the exact in-zone vendor);
# Valormok's Horde vendors sell NO recipes (Kurll and Gruul Darkblade
# stocks verified item by item), so the Horde and Alliance vendor sets are
# identical — stated, not padded. Seventeen are mob drops with sole
# in-zone droppers. Everything else Azshara-dropping is a generic
# multi-zone world drop (Elwynn rule, argued per case in the inventory);
# quest records carry no reward data, so none of that class ships (see
# docs/azshara-horde-companions-inventory.md and
# docs/companion-unverified.md). Trainer-taught staples are excluded:
# Polestar's own profession guides cover those. Each step is gated to its
# profession; other characters skip it cleanly. First Aid and Fishing have
# no Azshara source, so that is stated, not padded.
guide butler-routes-completionist/azshara-horde-recipes
title Azshara (Horde) - Recipes
levels 44-50
zone Azshara
faction Horde
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords azshara, horde, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Engineering — the auction house (Jubie Gadgetspring)

  zone map 1447

  when skill Engineering 1

  tip Jubie Gadgetspring (45.28, 90.95) at the auction house sells the schematic; the shop is neutral, so Horde characters can buy.
  buy 10607 "Schematic: Deepdive Helmet" npc 8678
  note Vendor-exclusive in the data (zero droppers anywhere). Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

step Leatherworking — the auction house (Blimo Gadgetspring)

  zone map 1447

  when skill Leatherworking 1

  tip Blimo Gadgetspring (45.21, 90.85) at the auction house sells all three patterns; the shop is neutral, so Horde characters can buy.
  buy 15729 "Pattern: Chimeric Gloves" npc 12957
  buy 15751 "Pattern: Blue Dragonscale Breastplate" npc 12957
  buy 227898 "Pattern: Honed Blue Dragonscale Breastplate" npc 12957
  note All three are vendor-exclusive in the data (zero droppers anywhere). Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

