step First Aid and Fishing — no Azshara Horde source

  note The data holds no First Aid or Fishing recipe sold by a Horde vendor or dropped in Azshara: no in-zone vendor sells one and no in-zone mob drops one. Polestar's own profession guides cover those professions' progression.
